@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

' === Deployment Nodes ===
node "Google Cloud Platform" {
    node "Google Kubernetes Engine" {
        component "Horizontal Pod Autoscaler"
        component "LoadBalancer Service" as lb
        component "Adapter Container" as adapter
        component "ConfigMap"
    }

    cloud "External Systems" {
        database "Google Cloud Pub/Sub"
        component "WebSocket Clients"
    }
}

' === Adapter Container Internal Components ===
component "websocketd" as websocketd
component "pulltop" as pulltop
component "exec.sh" as execsh
component "Message Cache" as cache

' === External Integrations ===
[Google Cloud Pub/Sub] --> pulltop : Consumes messages
[WebSocket Clients] --> lb : Connects via WebSocket

' === Configuration Flow ===
ConfigMap --> adapter : Injects SYMBOL env var\n(topic ID)

' === Internal Dependencies ===
adapter --> execsh : Launches with\nSYMBOL context
execsh --> pulltop : Starts with\ntopic parameter
pulltop --> websocketd : Streams output
websocketd --> cache : Stores last 10 messages
cache --> websocketd : Provides message history
lb --> adapter : Forwards traffic\n(port 80 → 8080)
Horizontal Pod Autoscaler --> adapter : Scales pods

note right of adapter
  Container includes:
  - websocketd (port 8080)
  - pulltop (Node.js)
  - exec.sh (entrypoint)
  - Message Cache (last 10 msgs)
end note

note right of ConfigMap
  Provides:
  - SYMBOL env var
  - Pub/Sub topic ID
end note

@enduml
